        <body>
            <div xml:id="d775">

                <pb facs="0671" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg659"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890D.01/649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Beirut</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gwynn</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beirut</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-09-12T09:00:00+02:00">September 12,
                            1942—9 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:06 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>340. My 317, August 31, 9 a.m. Syrian <hi rendition="#italic">Official
                        Journal</hi> September 3 publishes a decree of August 25 the substance of
                    which reads as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The hospital of the American Mission in Syria located at Deir ez Zor is
                            exempted for all direct taxes as of the date of its establishment. All
                            taxes paid by this hospital will be returned to it.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>It will be noted that the terms of the decree are much less comprehensive than
                    those of the note dated August 24. This latter in turn would appear to me
                    scarcely to satisfy the request contained in the informal <hi
                        rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> I left with the Syrian Foreign
                    Minister on August 20.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gwynn</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
